        "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_pod_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup"
      ],
      "title": "Work through the evidence: Read Pod and container evidence",
      "eyebrow": "Orders sandbox · explainer",
      "lineage": {
        "concept_ids": [
          "aws_devops.operate_an_eks_pod_using_supplied_cluster_access_setup"
        ],
